[
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "欢迎来到KC桌面。今天我们用一份最新\n研报，拆一个值得继续跟踪的问题。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 6.548,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "KC桌面",
      "最新研报"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "最近医药圈有个大新闻，马上要在ASC\nO年会上公布一项重磅临床数据，你听说\n了吗？",
    "start": 6.908,
    "end": 15.499,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "医药圈",
      "ASCO年会",
      "重磅临床数据"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "你说的是科伦博泰的sac-TMT吧，\n这个药在非小细胞肺癌上的三期数据确实\n很亮眼。",
    "start": 15.859,
    "end": 22.733,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "科伦博泰",
      "sac-TMT",
      "非小细胞肺癌"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "对，就是那个TROP-2 ADC。我\n看了那份投行研报，说它可能改变竞争格\n局，到底有多厉害？",
    "start": 23.093,
    "end": 31.173,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "TROP-2 ADC",
      "投行研报",
      "竞争格局"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "这么说吧，这个试验叫OptiTROP\n-Lung05，入组了413位PD-\nL1阳性的非小细胞肺癌患者。",
    "start": 31.533,
    "end": 40.171,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "OptiTROP-Lung05",
      "413位",
      "PD-L1阳性"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "sac-TMT联合K药，对比单用K药\n，无进展生存期PFS的风险比达到了0\n.35。",
    "start": 40.531,
    "end": 48.193,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "sac-TMT",
      "K药",
      "无进展生存期"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "35这个数字意味着什么？我听说其他方\n案大概在0.5左右。",
    "start": 48.553,
    "end": 54.033,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "35",
      "0.5"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "没错，之前像依沃西单抗或者K药联合化\n疗，PFS风险比大概在0.5附近。0\n.35就把这个标准提高了一大截，",
    "start": 54.393,
    "end": 65.167,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "依沃西单抗",
      "K药联合化疗",
      "PFS风险比"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "说明疾病进展风险降低了65%。",
    "start": 65.527,
    "end": 69.103,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "疾病进展风险",
      "65%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那客观缓解率呢？是不是也明显更好？",
    "start": 69.463,
    "end": 72.575,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "客观缓解率"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "联合治疗组的客观缓解率是70.2%，\n单用K药是42%，差不多提高了近30\n个百分点。",
    "start": 72.935,
    "end": 80.876,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "联合治疗组",
      "客观缓解率",
      "70.2%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "而且总生存期也看到了积极趋势，风险比\n0.55。",
    "start": 81.236,
    "end": 86.902,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "总生存期",
      "风险比",
      "0.55"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这里面有没有哪个亚组表现特别突出？",
    "start": 87.262,
    "end": 90.42,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "亚组"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "有个有意思的发现。PD-L1表达在1\n%到49%之间的患者，PFS风险比只\n有0.28，反而比高表达组0.",
    "start": 90.78,
    "end": 100.625,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "PD-L1表达",
      "1%",
      "49%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "47还要好。这个细节值得深入研究。",
    "start": 100.985,
    "end": 104.375,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "细节"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那这份研报的核心判断是什么？",
    "start": 104.735,
    "end": 107.336,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "核心判断"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "投行认为这是首个在PD-L1阳性非小\n细胞肺癌三期试验中，报告PFS改善的\nADC药物，数据相当鼓舞人心。",
    "start": 107.696,
    "end": 119.073,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "PD-L1阳性",
      "非小细胞肺癌",
      "三期试验"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "基于这个结果，他们把国内和海外的销售\n预期都大幅上调了。",
    "start": 119.433,
    "end": 124.774,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "国内",
      "海外",
      "销售预期"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "销售预期上调了多少？",
    "start": 125.134,
    "end": 127.317,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "销售预期"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "国内从46亿人民币上调到58亿，海外\n从65亿上调到105亿。目标价也从4\n38港元上调到544港元。",
    "start": 127.677,
    "end": 139.194,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "46亿人民币",
      "58亿",
      "65亿"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那这个药现在在中国是什么审批状态？",
    "start": 139.554,
    "end": 142.572,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "中国",
      "审批状态"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "已经进入优先审评通道了，基于这个数据\n。但研报里还留了一个悬念，没有完全展\n开。",
    "start": 142.932,
    "end": 152.313,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "优先审评通道"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "什么悬念？",
    "start": 152.673,
    "end": 153.974,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "悬念"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "就是之前公布的另一个全球三期试验Tr\nofuse-05的结果，那个试验也达\n到了主要终点。",
    "start": 154.334,
    "end": 161.439,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "全球三期试验",
      "Trofuse-05",
      "主要终点"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "这两个数据结合起来看，对sac-TM\nT未来在全球市场的定位会有更深的影响\n。",
    "start": 161.799,
    "end": 169.09,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "sac-TMT",
      "全球市场"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以如果想了解更完整的图景，还是得去\n看那份原始报告？",
    "start": 169.45,
    "end": 174.79,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "原始报告"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，而且公司在5月31号还会开一个电\n话会专门讨论ASCO数据，到时候会有\n更多细节。",
    "start": 175.15,
    "end": 182.86,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "5月31号",
      "电话会",
      "ASCO数据"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "好，那我们今天就先聊到这里。如果想获\n取完整研报或者加入我们的投研社群，欢\n迎在节目详情页查看。",
    "start": 183.22,
    "end": 192.879,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "完整研报",
      "投研社群"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "咱们下期再见。",
    "start": 193.239,
    "end": 194.632,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "下期再见"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
